<style>
  .root {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 24;
    gap: 12;
    background-color: rgba(0, 4, 16, 0.92);
    border-radius: 14;
    border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);
    border-width: 2;
    width: 380;
    height: 500;
  }
  .heading {
    font-size: 26;
    color: #00ffff;
  }
  .section {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6;
    width: 320;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 16;
    color: #ff88ff;
    margin-top: 6;
  }
  .control-row {
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 10;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .key {
    font-size: 13;
    color: #00ffff;
    background-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.12);
    padding: 4;
    border-radius: 4;
    border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-width: 1;
    min-width: 60;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .desc {
    font-size: 13;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  }
  .tip {
    font-size: 12;
    color: rgba(255, 200, 0, 0.7);
    margin-top: 4;
  }
  .divider {
    width: 300;
    height: 1;
    background-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }
  .btn {
    padding: 12;
    background-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 8;
    border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.35);
    border-width: 1;
    width: 200;
    align-items: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 8;
  }
  .btn-text {
    font-size: 16;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
</style>
<Panel class="root">
  <div class="heading">HOW TO PLAY</div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">KEYBOARD</div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="key">A/D or ←→</div>
      <div class="desc">Move left / right</div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="key">Space / W</div>
      <div class="desc">Flap (hold to float)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="key">E / Shift</div>
      <div class="desc">Dash (1.5s cooldown)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="key">F</div>
      <div class="desc">Bubble attack (stun, 3s cd)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="key">Esc / P</div>
      <div class="desc">Pause game</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">VR CONTROLLERS</div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="key">Thumbstick</div>
      <div class="desc">Move left / right</div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="key">Trigger</div>
      <div class="desc">Flap</div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="key">A / X Button</div>
      <div class="desc">Dash</div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="key">B Button</div>
      <div class="desc">Bubble attack (stun)</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">TIPS</div>
    <div class="tip">• Land on enemies from ABOVE to pop their balloons</div>
    <div class="tip">• Losing all balloons = parachute fall</div>
    <div class="tip">• Catch fish jumping from water for bonus points</div>
    <div class="tip">• Chain defeats for combo multipliers</div>
    <div class="tip">• Dash through danger with brief invincibility</div>
    <div class="tip">• Watch for whirlpools pulling you toward water!</div>
    <div class="tip">• Magnet enemies pull you in — keep your distance!</div>
    <div class="tip">• Teleporter enemies blink around unpredictably!</div>
    <div class="tip">• Orange crumbling platforms break after landing!</div>
    <div class="tip">• Shoot bubbles to stun enemies temporarily!</div>
    <div class="tip">• Double-tap flap quickly for a boost flap!</div>
    <div class="tip">• Watch for green acid rain in later phases!</div>
    <div class="tip">• Swarm bugs are fast but weak — combo them!</div>
    <div class="tip">• Red danger zones deal damage — dodge or dash!</div>
  </div>
  <div class="btn" id="btn-tutorial-back">
    <div class="btn-text">GOT IT!</div>
  </div>
</Panel>
